#Spacetime Plaza - Master File (For entire complex)
#Copyright (c) 2026-Present - Mn10

#Started on: 30 April 2026
#(Idea originated around April-May 2017.)

#Notes about this place:
	#General:
	#1. More restrooms will come as my time permits.
	#2. As the escalators can be created only in the floor mesh, they will disappear upon walking to another engine (such as between April DS and the main mall).
	#3. Please use your imagination for any missing "support columns" around this place. I can't always add every little detail for every building of mine.

	#4. As of 6 August 2026, only the parking spaces in the following areas have been completed:
		# 4.1 Easternmost shopping zone (Underneath the April DS, going north through the main mall, and ending below the Monica DS)
		# 4.2 Miriam Tower (Southwestern side of the complex)
		# 4.3 Westernmost shopping zone, between Miriam Tower and Lavender Moon Hotel
		# 4.4 Lumina Parking Garage (Levels B2 and B1 only)

	#Main mall:
	#1. Elevators 16-21 and 24-27 will not be used by the "random people" at all. This could be changed in Skyscraper Simulator's future updates.
	#2. On the 8th floor, there is not any wall south of Stairwell 6 as that area will be a storage.
	#3. Elevators 22-27 are meant to open directly to the underground parking areas (not enclosed by walls and doors).

	#April DS and Monica DS:
	#1. Atriums, railings, and escalators in these zones will be completed later.

